"""Generate a bilingual first-stage record from completed JSON files."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,csv,html
root=Path(__file__).parent
runs=[json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8')) for p in sorted((root/'results').glob('seed_*.json'))]
if len(runs)!=3: raise RuntimeError('Wait for all three runs before summarizing.')
fields=['seed','steps','converged','stable_periods_observed','frozen_mean_price','profit_gain','cycle_length','seconds']
with (root/'results/summary.csv').open('w',newline='',encoding='utf-8') as f:
    w=csv.DictWriter(f,fieldnames=fields);w.writeheader();w.writerows([{k:r[k] for k in fields} for r in runs])
ref=runs[0]['reference']
rows=''.join('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+html.escape(str(r[k]) if k not in ['frozen_mean_price','profit_gain','seconds'] else f'{r[k]:.6f}')+'</td>' for k in fields)+'</tr>' for r in runs)
report='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Q-learning collusion — first experiment</title><style>body{font:16px/1.8 system-ui,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 24px;color:#183347;background:#faf9f5}h1{line-height:1.4}table{border-collapse:collapse;background:white;width:100%;font-size:13px}td,th{border:1px solid #cdd6da;padding:10px;text-align:left}th{background:#e7edf0}.scroll{overflow:auto}pre{background:#183347;color:white;padding:22px;overflow:auto}a{color:#176287}</style></head><body><h1>算法定价与合谋<br>Algorithmic Pricing and Collusion</h1><p>第一阶段：三随机种子的有限实验 / Stage 1: a limited three-seed experiment</p><p>RICHINA ORTANCIA DOMINIQUE（杜米妮）</p><h2>研究问题 / Research question</h2><p>两个独立Q-learning定价算法能否形成高于竞争价格的稳定行为？ / Can two independent Q-learning pricing algorithms develop stable behavior above competitive prices?</p><p>基础文献 / Source: Calvano et al. (2020), <a href="https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.20190623">AER, DOI 10.1257/aer.20190623</a>.</p><h2>模型 / Model</h2><p>qᵢ = exp((aᵢ−pᵢ)/μ) / [exp(a₀/μ) + Σⱼ exp((aⱼ−pⱼ)/μ)]<br>πᵢ = (pᵢ−cᵢ)qᵢ<br>Qᵢ(s,a) ← (1−α)Qᵢ(s,a) + α[πᵢ + δ max Qᵢ(s′,·)]</p><p>n=2, c=1, a=2, a₀=0, μ=0.25, δ=0.95, α=0.15, β=4×10⁻⁶; εₜ=exp(−βt). 15个离散价格，上一期联合价格为状态。 / Fifteen discrete prices; the previous joint price is the state.</p><p>连续价格参考 / Continuous-price references: Nash = NASH; monopoly = MONOPOLY.</p><h2>实验记录 / Experiment record</h2><p>三个种子0、1、2；每个最多两百万期。收敛要求两个企业在所有状态的贪婪策略连续100,000期不变。原论文每组1000次实验并允许最多十亿期；本项目尚未运行完整参数网格。 / Seeds 0, 1, 2; up to two million periods each. Convergence requires unchanged greedy strategies at all states for 100,000 periods. The paper uses 1,000 sessions per experiment and a one-billion-period cap; the full grid is not run here.</p><div class="scroll"><table><tr>HEADERS</tr>ROWS</table></div><p>profit_gain = (每企业平均利润−Nash利润)/(垄断利润−Nash利润)。 / Profit gain normalizes mean per-firm profit between Nash and monopoly.</p><p><strong>未收敛试验的冻结策略结果仅为诊断，不能作为收敛结果。</strong> / Frozen-policy outcomes from nonconverged runs are diagnostic only. Frozen means are calculated over the eventual deterministic cycle reached from the final training state, with exploration and learning disabled.</p><p>训练期均值与冻结策略均值不同。高于竞争价格本身不足以证明合谋，仍需最佳反应和惩罚机制验证；此阶段不宣称复现原文的合谋频率。 / Training averages differ from frozen-policy averages. Supracompetitive prices alone do not establish collusion; best-response and punishment diagnostics remain necessary. This stage does not reproduce the paper's collusion frequency.</p><h2>代码与运行 / Code and execution</h2><ul><li><a href="Calvano_Qlearning_CN_EN.ipynb">Colab notebook / 中英文笔记本</a></li><li><a href="results/summary.csv">CSV结果 / Summary</a></li><li><a href="model.py">模型 / Model</a> · <a href="run_experiment.py">运行 / Runner</a> · <a href="verify.py">验证 / Verification</a></li><li><a href="README.md">说明 / README</a> · <a href="requirements.txt">依赖 / Requirements</a></li></ul><pre>python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
python verify.py
python run_experiment.py --steps 2000000 --seeds 0 1 2 --output results
python summarize.py</pre><p>已有results时，请改用新输出目录，避免覆盖。 / Use a new output directory if results already exist.</p><h2>验证与后续工作 / Validation and next steps</h2><p>已通过需求对称、基准价格、Nash附近单方偏离及固定种子重复性检查。独立Python实现，尚未与作者Fortran包逐项核对。 / Symmetry, reference-price, local Nash best-response and fixed-seed repeatability checks passed. This is an independent Python implementation, not yet audited against the authors' Fortran package.</p><p>下一步：提高运行上限、增加种子、验证稳定策略的最佳反应、分析偏离路径，并开展预先固定的稳健性实验。 / Next: extend the cap, add seeds, check best responses to stable policies, inspect deviation paths and run prespecified robustness exercises.</p><h2>AI使用 / AI use</h2><p>AI阅读用户提供的文章、提取参数、编写Python代码并运行检查和三次试验；未使用付费API。Colab笔记本提供可重新生成的价格演化图。 / AI extracted parameters from the supplied article, wrote the code, ran checks and executed three sessions. No paid API was used. The Colab notebook includes code to generate price-evolution plots.</p></body></html>'''
report=report.replace('NASH',f"{ref['nash_price']:.6f}").replace('MONOPOLY',f"{ref['monopoly_price']:.6f}").replace('HEADERS',''.join('<th>'+k+'</th>' for k in fields)).replace('ROWS',rows)
(root/'index.html').write_text(report,encoding='utf-8')
print(json.dumps([{k:r[k] for k in fields} for r in runs],indent=2))
